'' A VTABLE SLOT'S FUNCTION IS DECLARED ONCE. An importer that uses none of a module's
'' classes still builds their vtables, and reaches the methods only through them: Handler's
'' Query is in Handler's table and in Special's, and each table declared it -- clang refused
'' the second 'declare' as a redefinition (fbx/webview2's event handlers).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/vtunused/libs tests/modules/src/vtunused/main.bas -o tests/modules/vtunused.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/vtunused.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
